  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the response to displacement and management of the impact of the Sudan crisis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Funding Window allocation to the South Sudan Country Office is to manage the impact of the Sudan crisis alongside broader internal displacement crises, complementing ongoing Country Office (CO) plans and programmatic interventions. It proposes a mutually reinforcing two-pronged strategy aimed at positioning the CO as an integrator on the broader Humanitarian-Development-Peace (HDP) nexus and development solutions to forced displacement.</narrative>
  </description>
